# Quartz build artifacts.
# NOTE: content/ is NOT ignored — Quartz's file scan respects .gitignore, so
# ignoring content/ makes the build find 0 pages. content/ is a copy of
# "Vault/quartz chapters" refreshed on every build (local & Cloudflare).
